Package: rzigcausal
Type: Package
Title: Causal Discovery Demonstration for RZig
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marek", "Deja", email = "marekdejauj@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Demonstrates a Gaussian PC-stable skeleton search and a parallel
    correlation kernel written in Zig through RZig. The package emphasizes
    explicit validation, read-only inputs, safe native errors, and reproducible
    tests rather than providing a complete causal-discovery toolkit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MarekDejaUJ/rzig
BugReports: https://github.com/MarekDejaUJ/rzig/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Zig (>= 0.16.0), see https://ziglang.org/download/
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
